    "title": "Woman killed in crash with big rig in rural Collin County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Juan Carlos Chaoui ,\n1 days ago A woman died Tuesday after running a stop sign and colliding with a big rig in Collin County near Lucas, the Texas Department of Public Safety says. According to the DPS, the driver of a 2020 Chevrolet Spark headed east on Osage Lane didn't stop at the intersection and collided with a big rig headed north on Farm-to-Market Road 1378/Southview Drive. Read full article\n5",
